		(descr "BIGTREETECH TMC2209 V1.3 stepper driver module. Two 1x8 0.1in headers, rows 15.24mm (0.6in) apart, 2.54mm pitch (pins 1-16), plus 3 extra edge pads DIAG/INDEX/VREF (pins 17-19). MAIN 16 pins are the verified StepStick standard. VERIFY the 3 extra pad positions (17-19) against the BTT V1.3 SIZE PDF before fab.")
